  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">African media integrity and resilience programme: Ethiopia, Ghana, Central African Republic</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The project aims at strengthening journalistic skills of African journalists, through a tailored and needs-based approach; supporting media outlets reporting, editorial, production and broadcasting processes and capabilities; promoting a conducive environment and practical measures to ensure media independence, press freedom and safety of journalists and strengthening synergies between media outlets and other media ecosystems actors such as academia, fact-checking organisations, influencers, social media platforms in three pilot countries : Ghana, Central African Republic and Ethiopia.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
